{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c79a0682-4037-8c27-9cfc-a64952c0e2ae",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:30:18-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:26:31-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:26:35-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Um, I have some notes here, so I read slowly. My name is Teresa Medeiros. I am calling about a fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:26:44-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Are you putting one up, or is it a neighbor's fence you're concerned about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:26:52-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to put one. I want a privacy fence. My neighbor built a new deck, and now it looks right over my yard. Everybody on the deck can see me. It is very annoying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:27:05-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I see. That's a common reason for it. What's the address where the fence would go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:27:12-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four fifty-two Marsh Street. In the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:27:15-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 452 Marsh Street. And what kind of fence are you thinking about? Material, height?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:27:22-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cedar. Six feet tall. [pause] Six feet, yes. Wood, the solid kind, no spaces."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:27:28-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, six-foot solid cedar. And that would run along the side of the property where the deck is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:27:35-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the side and a little bit of the back. The man who builds it, he wants to start next week. So I ask, do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:27:48-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes. A fence in Newport usually needs a permit, and a six-foot one especially gets looked at, because height and placement on the lot matter. Your contractor should not start until it's approved. Is he handling the paperwork, or are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:28:04-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know. He did not say. I think maybe I do it. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:28:10-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:28:12-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you go. I am on speaker, so maybe it is hard to hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:28:18-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. I was just going to say, either one of you can apply, but it's the homeowner's name on it, so you'd want to know what he's doing. You'll need a simple sketch showing where the fence sits relative to your property lines."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:28:35-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. Okay. I write that down. [pause] And the fee. How much is the fee? I would like to know before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:28:44-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fee is based on the cost of the work, and I don't have the exact figure in front of me to quote you. The permit office can give you the amount when you submit the application. It's not usually a big one for a residential fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:29:01-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just do not want a surprise. Everything is a surprise with this deck already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:29:08-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understandable. Did the neighbor get a permit for the deck, do you know? If you think something was built without one, we can look into that separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:29:18-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know. Maybe. I only want the fence now. [line breaks up] Sorry, my car, the bluetooth, it connected to the wrong phone. I am in the car, so the call came out of the wrong place. Now it is on this speaker, with my husband's phone. It is a mess today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:29:38-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens. Can you still hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:29:42-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, now it is better. Please, so I bring the sketch to where?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:29:48-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring it to the inspections counter at City Hall, or send it in with the application. Include the fence height, the material, and the length. If anything's missing, we'll call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:30:00-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. My number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-six, if you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:30:04-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0156. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:30:08-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That is all in my notes. Thank you. I tell the man to wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:30:14-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please do. Have a good day, Ms. Medeiros."
    }
  ],
